{"availability":"available","full":"Abudora-0/Tessera","name":"Tessera","description":"A generative wallpaper studio. Draw wallpapers from a seed and export them pixel perfect for any screen, plus a Discover feed that aggregates free wallpapers from Unsplash, Pexels, Pixabay, Wallhaven and NASA.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-02T17:24:58Z","updated":"2026-09-10T09:34:50Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tesseera.vercel.app","topics":["api-aggregator","canvas","creative-coding","design-tools","generative-art","image-search","nextjs","procedural-generation","react","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel","wallpaper-generator","wallpapers"],"demo":"https://tesseera.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.825Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.825Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.825Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.825Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A generative wallpaper studio. Tessera does not store images, it draws them. Pick a family and a palette, shape the composition, then export a pixel perfect wallpaper for any phone, tablet or desktop.","Studio &middot; Discover &middot; How it works &middot; Deploy","Most wallpaper sites are heavy galleries of other people's photos, gated behind sign ups and ad walls, and the one image you like is never the right size for your screen. Tessera holds no images at all. It holds a drawing engine."],"features":["Twelve drawing families. Aurora, Mesh, Flow, Strata, Tessellate, Orbital,","Waveform, Bauhaus, Halftone, Terrazzo, Ripple and Marble, each a different algorithm for filling a frame.","Eight colour palettes. From Midnight and Ice to Ember and Neon, tuned by hand.","The Studio. Live preview with themed controls for density, contrast, detail,","turbulence and grain. Roll the seed until a piece stops you."],"sourc